To show that the neural SDE also works for the non-0p20 case, here are some results for the 0p10 (low amplitude) and 0p30 (high amplitude) cases. 0p10 I need to tune parameters to perhaps get a better PSD. 0p30, a very simple model works surprisingly well. 

The POD metrics use the definitions given above. The 0p10 reference is
training-trimmed, while the older 0p30 modal diagnostic uses the untrimmed
reference.

